  "notes": "Site authors zero CSS custom properties — the palette lives in flat utility classes (.acorns-green, .moss, .emerald, .ecru, .ivory, .fern, .acorns-purple), which is where the hexes above come from (exact, not sampled). Exceptions: band-forest (#3f5b3e) and border (#d9d9d9) are sampled from the calculator band and footer rules in the screenshots — the class palette has no match, so treat them as approximations. `craft.theme.supportsDark` reports true, but its payload is degenerate (bg rgba(0,0,0,0), fg #000) — there is no dark theme, so `color.dark` is omitted rather than invented. Type scale normalized to rem from a px scale (12/13/14/16/18/20/24/32/40/48/72); the raw profile's 13.6px/14.4px are browser-computed em fallbacks, dropped. Line-height set collapsed from 14 raw values; the 16px/16px pair (761 occurrences) is icon/inline-block noise, not a text leading. Radius normalized: raw 100px and 50px pills both map to the pill tier (9999px); 34px/24px/10px one-offs dropped. Two of the seven raw box-shadows were transparent or duplicate and were dropped. Durations 1080/1250/1300ms belong to the hero and testimonial crossfades only; UI chrome lives at 250–500ms."
